      "sourceTextSha256": "c0ec7ae2369ab554866b5d397acde801c6beb46b70d644889f7c2526acd33ee8",
      "text": "Gratuities for drivers and guides.\n\nIf necessary, Ada Tours may substitute other hotels of the same category for those listed.\n\nIf necessary, Ada Tours may change the order of excursions while preserving the tour itinerary.\n\nAda Tours is not responsible for missed hotel breakfasts when an early flight or excursion requires an early checkout.",
