      "sourceTextSha256": "84373e67714205db49496fc3bede57abf04b2f9107e63fc9b1cdd1ab49bb248b",
      "text": "Your adventure begins with your arrival and transfer to San Ignacio, the gateway to Belize’s jungle.\n\nOn the way, step back in time at Xunantunich, an impressive Mayan site perched above the jungle. Climb to the top of its main pyramid for sweeping views across Belize and into Guatemala.\n\nOvernight in San Ignacio.\n\nXunantunich visit depends on arrival point & time\n(Not possible if arriving late via international airport)",
